      "name": "Product Rule",
      "aliases": ["product rule", "乘法法则"],
      "definition_snippet": "If f and g are differentiable, d/dx[f(x)g(x)] = f'(x)g(x) + f(x)g'(x).",
      "category": "theorem"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quotient Rule",
      "aliases": ["quotient rule", "商法则"],
